WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:16.414
Miss Gray: It's the moment you've been waiting for, boys and girls.

2
00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:18.641
Daisy: Yay!

3
00:00:18.642 --> 00:00:21.101
Coby: What's our reward, Miss Gray?

4
00:00:21.102 --> 00:00:23.942
Jenna: It had better be a pizza party.

5
00:00:23.943 --> 00:00:26.718
Kara: My idea was much better, Jenna.

6
00:00:26.718 --> 00:00:29.267
I bet it got more votes.

7
00:00:29.268 --> 00:00:34.548
Miss Gray: Our reward will be . . . Silly Hair Day!

8
00:00:34.549 --> 00:00:35.668
Kara: Woo-hoo!

9
00:00:35.669 --> 00:00:38.292
Class: Yay!

10
00:00:38.293 --> 00:00:39.893
Jim: I forget.

11
00:00:39.893 --> 00:00:43.539
What do you do on Silly Hair Day?

12
00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.603
Coby: You make your hair look silly!

13
00:00:45.604 --> 00:00:51.030
Mark: Yeah. Last year I made my hair all spiky.

14
00:00:51.031 --> 00:00:53.745
Kara: I made my hair pink.

15
00:00:53.745 --> 00:00:56.668
I looked beautiful.

16
00:00:56.669 --> 00:01:00.703
Jenna: Well, I looked ridiculous!

17
00:01:00.703 --> 00:01:03.814
I hate Silly Hair Day!

18
00:01:03.815 --> 00:01:08.338
Kara: Miss Gray! Jenna isn't being nice about Silly Hair Day.

19
00:01:08.339 --> 00:01:17.735
Miss Gray: Oh. Well, maybe Jenna will change her mind.

20
00:01:17.736 --> 00:01:21.980
Mr. Gibson: Silly Hair Day sounds fun, Jenna.

21
00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:24.891
Jenna: It's not fun, Dad.

22
00:01:24.892 --> 00:01:29.006
Jenna: I like pretty hair, not silly hair.

23
00:01:29.007 --> 00:01:32.814
Mrs. Gibson: How are you going to make it look silly tomorrow?

24
00:01:32.815 --> 00:01:36.910
Jenna: I'm trying not to think about it.

25
00:01:36.911 --> 00:01:42.179
Mr. Gibson: You could make funny pigtails.

26
00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:51.469
Mrs. Gibson: Or dye your hair pink.

27
00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:54.373
Jenna: No pink!

28
00:01:54.374 --> 00:02:05.576
Mrs. Gibson: Okay. What about purple?

29
00:02:05.577 --> 00:02:10.806
Jenna: That is my favorite color.

30
00:02:10.807 --> 00:02:21.772
Mrs. Gibson: Well, then I have an idea . . .

31
00:02:21.773 --> 00:02:24.696
Kara: Here comes Jenna!

32
00:02:24.697 --> 00:02:31.223
Maya: Ha-ha! Look at her hair!

33
00:02:31.224 --> 00:02:33.881
Coby: She doesn't look very happy.

34
00:02:33.882 --> 00:02:45.503
Mark: Nope. But she looks very silly!
